    "description": {
      "content": "The Nutritionix Track API converts natural-language food and exercise descriptions into detailed nutrient and calorie analysis, and provides search and lookup access to the world's largest verified nutrition database, including USDA-linked common foods and over a million branded and restaurant menu items.\n\nContact Support:\n Name: Nutritionix Developer Support",
